ct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids came in at 38% and November to December at 41%. Every grid had its driest year in 1953, with grid 21160 at 57%.</p>"}
